WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
 

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:10.700
 

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:17.020
I have some questions for you

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.400
Professor

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.840
This is a suprise

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:25.100
There is a rumor that Newt Scamader is headed to Paris

00:00:29.155 --> 00:00:31.725
I know he is working under your orders

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:36.100
What do you have to say for yourself, Dumbledore

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:41.075
If you had ever had the pleasure to teach him, you know

00:00:41.075 --> 00:00:43.915
That Newt is not a great follower of orders

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.205
The time is coming Newt

00:00:54.025 --> 00:00:55.945
When you're going to have to pick a side

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.780
Are you going somewhere?
No. We're going somewhere

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:04.460
Jeez!

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:34.120
I can't move against Grindelwald.

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:36.705
It has to be you

00:01:45.645 --> 00:01:46.645
 

